        "original_id": "14e2e38e-bb1c-550a-85a1-7f0d6ac777dd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jaume Collet-Serra, Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Michelle Dockery, Lupita Nyong'o, Scoot McNairy, Andrew Rona\n- Films: Non-Stop, Project X, Equilibrium, Scream, Scary Movie\n- Television Series: Downton Abbey\n- Roles: Lady Mary Crawley\n- Topics: film production, acting awards\n\nFacts:\n- From 2010 to 2015, Michelle Dockery was widely known for playing Lady Mary Crawley in the television period drama series Downton Abbey.\n- For Downton Abbey, Michelle Dockery received three consecutive Emmy Award nominations for Outstanding Lead Actress in a Drama Series and a Golden Globe Award nomination.\n- In 2014, Non-Stop was released as an American mystery action thriller film directed by Jaume Collet-Serra.\n- Non-Stop stars Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Michelle Dockery, Lupita Nyong'o, and Scoot McNairy.\n- Andrew Rona has produced over 100 films, including Non-Stop, Project X, Equilibrium, Scream, and Scary Movie.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
